/v1/","context":{"app_id":4811700,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1847286114027168","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam NextFest Day 2 - Mancalero Dev Plays!","summary":"NextFest Day 2 Hype!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:49:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027168","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:09:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1846651706693203","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"announcement","title":"First Mancalero NextFest Playthrough!","summary":"Let's play Mancalero!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T00:30:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693203","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1846651706679080","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"update","title":"Capsule Marble Hotfix","summary":"Hey Mancalero candidates! There was quite the error allowing for Capsule Marble upgrades to persist between runs, making the demo far easier than intended for those of you who decided to invest in capsule upgrades. This has been patched in the most recent Hotfix, apologies for the error. Please enjoy your runs and stay tuned for the full game! Grace and peace, ArchiusDev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:31:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1846018067926736","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"update","title":"The Big v1.02 Update is Here!","summary":"Mancalero Demo v1.02 Update New: a hidden Endless bossSomething ancient has been coiled beneath the board. Push deep enough into Endless, and a new, hidden boss may rise to take the boss slot. It's rare, it hits hard, and it doesn't play fair. I won't say any more than that, seriously, no hints!A new hidden achievement is waiting for anyone who beats it.Spoiler version, okay fine if you'd rather me say it outright: The Ancient Serpent, is a new boss that appears in endless only from the second E","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:21:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926736","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1844115010499565","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"announcement","title":"Major UI, Settings and Resolution Changes","summary":"Hey Players, These updates are a bit more frequent than I'd normally have in mind, but I'd rather not wait until NextFest for some of these fixes. Many thanks to the players who've identified these issues on various settings, resolutions, etc and apologies for getting used to some of them on my end! This update has some fixes for the tutorial, resolution, settings and quality of life. Patch NotesMancalero now launches in fullscreen — and Settings has a new Display Mode selection (Fullscreen/Bord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T18:02:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499565","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1844115010497488","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update","summary":"Hey budding Mancalero players! I overlooked a significant portion of some localization pieces and fixes for consistency across the game and the game board, and for that, I sincerely apologize. Additionally, I incorrectly had Spanish - Spain on the interface when the game only supports Latin American Spanish. These have been corrected. These are the changes in the patch. Localization Tutorial (all steps, buttons, hints, first-time prompt) fully translatedHow To Play guide (all 4 tabs) fully trans","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T16:50:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1844115010491790","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"update","title":"Demo v13.11.1119 Patch Notes","summary":"Hey all, Small update to apply some fixes and slight rebalancing. Grace and peace,ArchiusDev Patch NotesUnlocks now apply starting your next run, not mid-run - unlocking a new marble or blessing means that you can use it in your next run, it won't immediately be added to the current pool of the run that unlocked them. Gold Marble now unlocks after spending $35 in a single Bazaar visit (a bit of an increase from requiring $20).Fixed a bug where buying Capsules didn't count toward Gold marble's un","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T11:51:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010491790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811700-1843481262705456","game_id":"steam-4811700","kind":"announcement","title":"MacOS Launch Options","summary":"Apologies for the confusion, now the launch options on MacOS will clearly display the correct version based on your architecture- make sure to use Apple Silicon if you're using the M-series chips or Intel if you have those. Using the wrong one will negatively affect frame rate and your overall experience. Grace and peace, ArchiusDev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T19:08:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705456","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4811700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4811700":"2026-10-26T04:26:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4811700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4861930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:26:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4811700","app_id":4811700,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:59Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6bb8daedfab5d3ee9f181235c0b356c6427f61916264635f510c60bf2deb7415","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Mancalero는 로그라이크 진행과 덱빌더 전략을 결합한 구슬 보드 게임입니다. 특수 구슬을 모으고, 강력한 축복을 해제하며, 모든 테이블을 정복해 진정한 Mancalero가 되세요.","publishers":[{"name":"ArchiusDev"}],"developers":[{"name":"ArchiusDev"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793808000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Mancalero v1.02 Demo Trailer - October NextFest